# duckweed-logbook 全仓属性
# 2026-10-15 从 05.Spring-semester-of-the-sophomore-year/.gitattributes 提到仓库根，
# 让 11 个学期共用一份；同时补齐本库实际用到的二进制类型。

# 文本文件统一按 LF 存进版本库。
# 在 Windows 上提交时看到 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 属正常现象。
* text=auto

## 常见二进制类型：不要让 git 拿它们当文本做差异 / 合并
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.doc   binary
*.pptx  binary
*.ppt   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.xls   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.bmp   binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary
*.rar   binary
*.7z    binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.step  binary
*.stp   binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.mp4   binary

